{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.8, "text": "In this town, you get paid for being unlucky."}, {"start": 3.22, "end": 4.8, "text": "Miss your bus? $100."}, {"start": 5.4, "end": 7.26, "text": "Get caught in the rain? $500."}, {"start": 8.02, "end": 10.74, "text": "And if your house gets destroyed? $1,000,000!"}, {"start": 11.5, "end": 14.08, "text": "That's why the unluckiest people are the richest."}, {"start": 14.56, "end": 16.88, "text": "My neighbor got struck by lightning three times."}, {"start": 17.28, "end": 18.38, "text": "Now he owns a mansion."}, {"start": 18.7, "end": 19.84, "text": "And the richest man in town?"}, {"start": 20.14, "end": 22.44, "text": "His private jet crashed into his swimming pool."}, {"start": 22.7, "end": 24.34, "text": "He earned $50,000,000!"}, {"start": 25.1, "end": 25.62, "text": "But me?"}, {"start": 26.04, "end": 28.66, "text": "My name is Milo, and I have a huge problem."}, {"start": 28.66, "end": 30.48, "text": "I've never been unlucky."}, {"start": 31.18, "end": 33.38, "text": "Every single day, something good happens to me."}, {"start": 33.72, "end": 35.3, "text": "One morning, I missed my school bus."}, {"start": 35.64, "end": 37.28, "text": "I thought I'd finally earned $100."}, {"start": 37.88, "end": 39.9, "text": "But then, a limousine pulled up."}, {"start": 40.14, "end": 41.84, "text": "The driver offered me a free ride."}, {"start": 42.3, "end": 42.7, "text": "$0."}, {"start": 43.22, "end": 45.98, "text": "Another day, I walked outside during a thunderstorm."}, {"start": 46.28, "end": 48.72, "text": "I stood there, waiting to get completely soaked."}, {"start": 49.02, "end": 51.62, "text": "But the second I stepped outside, the rain stopped."}, {"start": 52.02, "end": 53.8, "text": "And a beautiful rainbow appeared."}, {"start": 54.32, "end": 55.34, "text": "$0 again."}, {"start": 55.76, "end": 57.98, "text": "I even bought a lottery ticket, hoping to lose."}, {"start": 57.98, "end": 60.6, "text": "But somehow, I won the jackpot!"}, {"start": 61.14, "end": 63.82, "text": "Unfortunately, winning money doesn't count as bad luck."}, {"start": 64.16, "end": 65.3, "text": "And because I was still a kid,"}, {"start": 65.56, "end": 67.98, "text": "the prize went straight into a locked savings account."}, {"start": 68.32, "end": 69.28, "text": "I was still broke."}, {"start": 69.72, "end": 73.3, "text": "Meanwhile, my best friend accidentally dropped his phone into a toilet."}, {"start": 73.76, "end": 74.56, "text": "$10,000!"}, {"start": 75.2, "end": 76.44, "text": "He bought a sports car."}, {"start": 76.74, "end": 77.42, "text": "I'd had enough."}, {"start": 77.82, "end": 80.54, "text": "So, I visited the city's official bad luck center."}, {"start": 80.82, "end": 82.16, "text": "The worker scanned my face."}, {"start": 82.54, "end": 85.0, "text": "Then, he looked at the screen and started laughing."}, {"start": 85.0, "end": 87.94, "text": "Sir, you have 0% bad luck."}, {"start": 88.42, "end": 89.44, "text": "I couldn't believe it."}, {"start": 89.7, "end": 91.84, "text": "So, I decided to try one last thing."}, {"start": 92.18, "end": 94.9, "text": "I climbed onto a bus that was famous for breaking down."}, {"start": 95.22, "end": 97.9, "text": "Halfway through the journey, the engine started smoking."}, {"start": 98.46, "end": 98.64, "text": "Finally!"}, {"start": 99.22, "end": 100.46, "text": "But just as I celebrated,"}, {"start": 100.8, "end": 103.36, "text": "a mechanic appeared and fixed it in 10 seconds."}, {"start": 103.68, "end": 106.28, "text": "The bus driver even gave me a free lifetime pass."}, {"start": 106.7, "end": 108.46, "text": "I went home completely defeated."}, {"start": 108.88, "end": 111.3, "text": "Everyone else was getting rich from their terrible luck,"}, {"start": 111.36, "end": 112.94, "text": "while my life was perfect."}, {"start": 112.94, "end": 114.78, "text": "I sat on my bed and whispered,"}, {"start": 115.32, "end": 117.46, "text": "why can't one bad thing happen to me?"}, {"start": 118.24, "end": 119.76, "text": "Suddenly, my phone started beeping."}, {"start": 120.06, "end": 120.82, "text": "A message appeared."}, {"start": 121.92, "end": 122.22, "text": "Congratulations, Milo."}, {"start": 122.7, "end": 126.52, "text": "You have officially been declared the unluckiest person in history."}, {"start": 126.92, "end": 127.44, "text": "I froze."}, {"start": 127.94, "end": 128.78, "text": "The message continued."}, {"start": 129.18, "end": 131.14, "text": "In a world where bad luck makes you rich,"}, {"start": 131.54, "end": 134.28, "text": "having perfect luck is the worst luck of all."}, {"start": 134.62, "end": 135.54, "text": "And just like that,"}, {"start": 135.92, "end": 138.42, "text": "$1 billion appeared in my bank account."}, {"start": 138.66, "end": 140.98, "text": "I was finally the richest person in town."}, {"start": 140.98, "end": 142.78, "text": "And for the first time in my life,"}, {"start": 143.14, "end": 144.62, "text": "I was happy to be unlucky."}], "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.22}, {"w": "this", "s": 0.22, "e": 0.44}, {"w": "town,", "s": 0.44, "e": 0.78}, {"w": "you", "s": 1.08, "e": 1.16}, {"w": "get", "s": 1.16, "e": 1.36}, {"w": "paid", "s": 1.36, "e": 1.7}, {"w": "for", "s": 1.7, "e": 2.0}, {"w": "being", "s": 2.0, "e": 2.22}, {"w": "unlucky.", "s": 2.22, "e": 2.8}, {"w": "Miss", "s": 3.22, "e": 3.44}, {"w": "your", "s": 3.44, "e": 3.6}, {"w": "bus?", "s": 3.6, "e": 3.86}, {"w": "$100.", "s": 4.28, "e": 4.8}, {"w": "Get", "s": 5.4, "e": 5.66}, {"w": "caught", "s": 5.66, "e": 5.88}, {"w": "in", "s": 5.88, "e": 6.02}, {"w": "the", "s": 6.02, "e": 6.1}, {"w": "rain?", "s": 6.1, "e": 6.36}, {"w": "$500.", "s": 6.76, "e": 7.26}, {"w": "And", "s": 8.02, "e": 8.16}, {"w": "if", "s": 8.16, "e": 8.26}, {"w": "your", "s": 8.26, "e": 8.4}, {"w": "house", "s": 8.4, "e": 8.64}, {"w": "gets", "s": 8.64, "e": 8.86}, {"w": "destroyed?", "s": 8.86, "e": 9.32}, {"w": "$1", "s": 9.86, 